# Project memory (Memrize)

This repo uses **Memrize** for persistent project memory alongside Cursor & Hermes memory systems.

- **Project DB:** `.memrize/memrize.db` (gitignored)
- **Global rules:** `~/.memrize/global.db` via `memrize-global` MCP
- **Session start:** call `memrize_get_context` on `memrize-project` MCP or `scripts/memrize/context.sh`

Report failures: `scripts/memrize/report-error.sh <type> "<title>"`
